		{"id":"37bd85094aaf5349","type":"text","text":"#### Re:REPLY Card: (text input)\nHi callSign, \nThank you for responding to our invitation. I know I should've mentioned this earlier but one of our mates conflicted with the schedule and we really need her for this motion. Could we kindly ask that we change the date to your second option? Then we are good to go! I apologize again for the inconvenience.","x":-654,"y":-5756,"width":582,"height":230,"color":"#666dd5"},
