		{"id":"53bc15e2a4ffd68a","type":"text","text":"# Note: Division at Genre\n### Team Name agreed to an invitation from Team Name \n#### Last checked date","x":2420,"y":-7475,"width":392,"height":194,"color":"#666dd5"},
		{"id":"aed3115dcd8c0fc4","type":"text","text":"","x":2902,"y":-7588,"width":50,"height":407,"color":"#666dd5"},
		{"id":"24fbd667e56a6dd7","type":"text","text":"#### Card: (text output)\nDear callSign et al of Team Name, \nHope everyone is having a pleasant week. My teammates and I would like to cordially invite you to the above async debate round. With alternative start dates to include: \nYYMMDD @ hh:mm\nYYMMDD @ hh:mm\nIf the date above does not work for you, please reply with your preferred timelines and and our team will review the dates. Thank you for your consideration. \nWarmly, callSign et al. of Team Name\n","x":-6827,"y":-4153,"width":582,"height":600,"color":"#666dd5"},
		{"id":"c8159d0bddaa043b","type":"text","text":"# messageID Details\n\nsenderID\nreceiverID\n\nmessageType\n- `LINKED_PlayerToSupervisor`\n- `LINKED_SupervisorToPlayer`\n- `LINKED_PlayerToPlayer`\n- `ASKING_PlayerToTeamFounder` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class\n- `ASKING_TeamFounderToPlayer` (urge to join) team join request is separate via invitation class\n- `LINKED_TeamMateToTeamFounder`\n- `LINKED_TeamFounderToTeamMate`\n- `ASKING_TeamToEnabler`\n- `RESPONDING_EnablerToTeam` (only as a response)\n- `ASKING_EnablerToEnabler`\n\n\nrelatedActivityID\ntimestamp\nmessageContent\nreplyToMessageID\n\nattachment\n\nisDelivered for sender\nisRead for receiver\nexpiryDate\n\nstatus (active, archived, deleted)\n\nautomatically expires (i.e., on the 15th day) and deleted unless the message is active or has been archieved within 14 days. \n","x":-6078,"y":-4353,"width":463,"height":957},
