		{"id":"dcf54dee7b6ac307","type":"text","text":"#### messageID = First message\n#### replyTo(1) = reply to: {messageID}\n#### replyTo(2) = reply to: {replytomessageID} ...\n\nFirst messageID is linked to subsequent replytomessageIDs and thus create a message thread. These threads will expire if no activity has been detected for 14 days. Users can archive portions of their threads before it is deleted. \n\n\n\n","x":-8578,"y":-1714,"width":582,"height":352,"color":"#666dd5"},
