		{"id":"16bb8c544d432a23","type":"text","text":"#### messageID = First message\n##### Dear callSign et al. of Team Name, \n###### Hope everyone is having a pleasant week. My teammates and I would like to cordially invite you to the above ActivityID. Given that invitations are more formal require our Supervisor approval, I wanted to reach out to you first. Also I was hoping to join your TeamMate03 position as it was vacant.\n\n\n","x":-7618,"y":1900,"width":582,"height":355,"color":"#666dd5"},
