		{"id":"d7c05178a3787ab9","type":"text","text":"#### messageID: (text output)\nDear callSign,\n\nHope you are doing well. I wanted to ask you about the ResourceID you curated last week. It was really eye opening and would like to pick your brains on how to something on my own. If you can share a few minutes over Zoom or your referred tool to help me get started, that would be great! Warm regards, callSign","x":-9610,"y":1917,"width":582,"height":343,"color":"#666dd5"},
