		{"id":"ab7c58bcc6ccfa9a","type":"text","text":"#### messageID: (text output)\nDear callSign,\n\nHope you are having a pleasant week. I wanted to ask if you'd be interested in judging a round for the Activity above. \n\nOur team was so grately for your insight feedback from the last round and all agreed to ask you to render another fair decision. \n\nWarm regards, \ncallSign","x":-8634,"y":1914,"width":582,"height":343,"color":"#666dd5"},
