		{"id":"792c4d17b0c2d1c1","type":"text","text":"#### replyTo(1): (text output)\nDear callSign of Team Name,\nThank you for the kind words and reaching out to me.\n\nMy schedule seems to be available for this ActivityID and I've safely secured a slot to submit a Ballot. Also I took the liberty of inviting my friend who is a level 1 Adjudicator but has been training with us for the past 3 weeks. \n\nWarm regards, \ncallSign","x":-8641,"y":3225,"width":582,"height":320,"color":"#666dd5"},
