		{"id":"eac4ca660cbe3232","type":"text","text":"#### replyTo(1): (text output)\nDear callSign,\nThank you for the kind words and reaching out to me.\nI would probably look at PROCON.org to get a grasp of the key arguments surrounding a motion and extract a list of keyword to do further research. \nWarm regards, \ncallSign","x":-9604,"y":3203,"width":582,"height":320,"color":"#666dd5"},
